| Concept                                      | Explanation                                                                      |
| -------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `application.properties` / `application.yml` | Central config (e.g., DB URL, port).                                             |
| External values                              | Use `@Value("${property.key}")`.                                                 |
| `@ConfigurationProperties`                   | Bind multiple properties to a POJO.                                              |
| Profiles                                     | Different env setups — dev/test/prod. Activate via `spring.profiles.active=dev`. |


